+
 // Terminals known to correctly implement the Kitty keyboard protocol
 // (CSI >1u) and/or xterm modifyOtherKeys (CSI >4;2m) for ctrl+shift+<letter>
 // disambiguation. We previously enabled unconditionally (#23350), assuming
